    "7503555367633158144": {
      "conference": true,
      "detail": {
        "copyright": "Pau Barrena",
        "headline": "Mauro Lustrinelli on facing Schalke",
        "text": "\"Schalke played the game as they would have wanted to [vs. Bayern]. They were aggressive, compact, willing to run and strong in the duels and played like that until the end. But every game is interesting, and it will be a very different game at der Alten Försterei. We know what mentality they have and we’ll be ready.\"",
        "url": "https://assets.bundesliga.com/contender/2026/8/GettyImages-2293643478.jpg?crop=231px,158px,4146px,2760px"
      },
